---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="About the Project | BitsNotes" 
  description="Learn about the mission of BitsNotes - providing free, secure, high-quality learning resources and lecture notes to students."
  theme="light"
>
  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-16 flex-grow">
    
    <!-- Title Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">
      <span class="inline-block text-xs font-bold text-indigo-600 uppercase tracking-widest bg-indigo-50 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg mb-4">Our Mission</span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Empowering Students Through Secure, Open Education
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-base md:text-lg">
        Bridging the gap between accessible educational materials and content protection.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content Section -->
    <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-100 p-8 md:p-12 shadow-xl shadow-slate-100/40 relative overflow-hidden mb-12">
      <!-- Decorative background glow -->
      <div class="absolute right-0 top-0 -mt-16 -mr-16 w-48 h-48 bg-indigo-50 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

      <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none space-y-6 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-indigo-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253"></path>
          </svg>
          Who We Are
        </h2>
        <p>
          Welcome to <strong>BitsNotes</strong>! This platform was created by a dedicated classroom teacher to provide students with free, high-quality, and instant access to detailed lecture notes, study guides, and exam preparation materials. Learning shouldn't be gated behind costly subscription models or slow print distribution.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-indigo-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"></path>
          </svg>
          Why Security Matters
        </h2>
        <p>
          As educators, we invest hundreds of hours drafting, proofreading, and structuring our learning materials. When PDF files are distributed freely online, they are often scraped, uploaded to commercial homework-sharing platforms, or distributed without permission. 
        </p>
        <p>
          To solve this problem, <strong>BitsNotes</strong> displays lecture notes inside a secure, view-only browser container. By converting documents into flat, non-downloadable images and blocking common copy/print commands, we can share our academic content with students for free on their laptops and phones, while keeping the original files protected.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-indigo-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z"></path>
          </svg>
          AdSense Support & Open Access
        </h2>
        <p>
          To keep this resource 100% free for all students and cover the cloud storage and hosting fees, we partner with premium ad programs like <strong>Google AdSense</strong>. We balance educational needs with monetization by displaying unobtrusive standard advertisement banners alongside our study tools. This setup supports the website infrastructure without compromising the clean, focused reading experience students need during study sessions.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature Grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mt-10 pt-10 border-t border-slate-100">
        <div class="p-5 bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-indigo-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-indigo-600 mb-3.5">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-sm">Strict Security</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1 leading-relaxed">Prevents PDF saving, printing, right-clicking, and text scraping.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="p-5 bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-indigo-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-indigo-600 mb-3.5">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-sm">Blazing Fast</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1 leading-relaxed">Powered by Cloudflare Workers and R2 for rapid page rendering.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-indigo-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-indigo-600 mb-3.5">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-sm">Study Aids</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1 leading-relaxed">Integrated core concepts, breakdowns, and practice quizzes on pages.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
